1
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:03,980
赖利·莫顿上场
Riley Morton coming up now.

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:06,800
之后是凯利 开局就是个漂亮的双杀
Kelly at second. Started the inning with a double.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,920
局势看起来跟一小时前一样
That seems like an hour ago.

4
00:00:09,406 --> 00:00:11,165
-亲爱的 你不是要倒垃圾嘛 -是的
- Honey, I thought you were gonna take out the garbage. - I am.

5
00:00:11,557 --> 00:00:15,224
右侧高飞球 曲线飞出 界外球
High fly to right. Hooking, hooking- Foul.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,560
-菲尔 -收到 马上去
- Phil. - Yes. Getting it.

7
00:00:22,779 --> 00:00:24,406
我本来马上就要去倒的
I was- I was gonna get it.

8
00:00:27,749 --> 00:00:29,261
-迪兰 -你好 邓菲太太
- Dylan. - Hey, Mrs. Dunphy.

9
00:00:29,261 --> 00:00:30,956
我在等海莉
Um, I'm just waiting for Haley.

10
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,000
-你按门铃了吗 -我给她发短信了
- Did you ring the bell? - I texted.

11
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:35,780
她说她马上就下来
She said she'd be down in just a minute.

12
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:38,800
-那好 替我向她问好 -没问题
- Oh, great. Tell her I said "Hi." - I will.

13
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,900
迪兰 迪迪仔
Dylan! D-Money!

14
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:43,610
古惑小迪仔 快乐摇又摆
Chillin' with Dylan the villain!

15
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:45,780
-小迪的迪 迪兰的兰 -邓菲先生
- "D" To the "Y" To the- - Hey, Mr. Dunphy.

16
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,020
快进来
Hey! Come on in.

17
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:48,540
你刚好赶上看比赛结果
You're just in time to catch the end of the game.

18
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,720
我实在对棒球无爱
Oh, I'm not really a baseball guy.

19
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:52,461
海莉也向你问好
Haley says "Hi."

20
00:00:52,461 --> 00:00:53,620
我刚刚是开玩笑的啦
I was just being facetious.

21
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:55,240
来 叔跟你说说赛况
Come on. I'll catch you up.

22
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:57,200
坐下 速度点
Sit it. Park it.

23
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:00,200
放轻松 人家又不会吃了你
Come on. I don't bite.

24
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:03,360
逗你玩儿
Kidding.

25
00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:04,800
逗你玩的啦
I'm kidding.

26
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:07,180
看到那家伙了吗 就是他把比分拉平的
Okay. See that guy? He's the tying run.

27
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:08,720
特别有趣的是
Interesting story about him.

28
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:10,880
他一直被困在"二垒"那一步
He's been stuck on second base forever,

29
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:12,940
我敢说他要试着偷上"三垒"了
and I'm pretty sure he's gonna try and steal third,

30
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,780
我觉得这是个馊主意
which is just a terrible, terrible idea.

31
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:17,200
你跟海莉上到几垒了
How are you and Haley doing?

32
00:01:23,940 --> 00:01:27,060
我真希望能跟你一起宅在家玩玩具飞机
I wish I could stay home with you and fly toy airplanes.

33
00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:28,720
这可不是玩具飞机 曼尼
These aren't toy airplanes, Manny.

34
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:30,619
这叫模型 非常复杂的玩意儿
These are models, and they're very complicated.

35
00:01:30,619 --> 00:01:34,280
要想成功让它飞起来 就必须了解螺旋桨
You wanna fly one of these, you gotta be familiar with airfoil,

36
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:36,160
拉你 空气浮力和推力等等
drag, lift and thrust-

37
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:38,000
全都是航空动力学的基本原理
and these are all principles of aerodynamics.

38
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:39,820
可盒子上写着"适宜12岁及以上人群"
The box says "12 and up."

39
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:41,480
什么
What?

40
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:45,180
下次你再跟杰一起玩飞机
You can fly toy planes with Jay next time.

41
00:01:45,260 --> 00:01:47,320
-今天你得跟卢克待在一起 -为啥啊
- Today you have to spend time with Luke. - Why?

42
00:01:47,580 --> 00:01:49,600
因为他妈邀请你去 所以你就得去
Because his mother invited you, so you go.

43
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:51,740
家庭成员间需要亲密相处 对吧 杰
Family needs to be close. Right, Jay?

44
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,600
这肯定是印刷错误
I'm pretty sure this is a typo.

45
00:01:54,360 --> 00:01:57,620
男人得有点爱好 曼尼他亲爹可有一大堆
Men need their hobbies. Manny's father had many hobbies.

46
00:01:57,860 --> 00:01:59,440
比如沙漠徒步旅行
Like hiking in the desert,

47
00:01:59,880 --> 00:02:02,300
还有从那什么玩意儿上蹦下来滑雪的那个
that kind of skiing that they drop you from the-

48
00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:03,320
那玩意儿用英语怎么说来着
How do you say in English?

49
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,880
-直升机 -没错
- Helicopter. - Yes.

50
00:02:06,380 --> 00:02:09,259
有一次 他被人激将 竟然跟鳄鱼打拳击
Once, on a dare, he even boxed with an alligator.

51
00:02:09,259 --> 00:02:11,376
那叫格斗 格斗
"Wrestle." You wrestle-

52
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:13,280
跟鳄鱼可打不了拳击
You can't box with alligators.

53
00:02:13,428 --> 00:02:14,326
你确定吗
Are you sure?

54
00:02:14,780 --> 00:02:16,780
就它们那小爪子怎么戴得上拳击手套
How would they get the gloves on those little claws?

55
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:19,620
-看起来不像小手手吗 -像个屁
- Aren't they like tiny little hands? - No!

56
00:02:20,976 --> 00:02:22,740
好吧 现在我都忘了我们刚刚在说什么了
Okay, now I forgot what we're talking about.

57
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:25,980
不管怎样 对爷们儿来说 兴趣爱好很重要
Anyways, hobbies are important for the men,

58
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:28,160
无论是以命相赌的惊险爱好
whether you're risking your life...

59
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:30,640
或是离得远远地玩小飞机都一样
or flying little planes from a safe distance.

60
00:02:35,060 --> 00:02:36,378
等等 这是要去哪儿
Wait, wait, wait. What are you doing?

61
00:02:36,378 --> 00:02:39,313
我们得去买点尿布 几分钟就好
Uh, we're just gonna buy some diapers. It'll just take a second.

62
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:42,560
-是好市多超市哎 -没错 就是买尿布的地方啊
- This is Costco. - Yeah, which is where we buy diapers.

63
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:43,640
什么时候开始的
Since when?

64
00:02:43,980 --> 00:02:47,140
你还记得几个月前我们收养了个孩子吗
Do you remember when we adopted that baby a few months back?

65
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:47,740
就从那时起
Since then.

66
00:02:50,900 --> 00:02:52,220
米奇尔是个势利小人
Mitchell is a snob.

67
00:02:52,287 --> 00:02:55,381
才不是 人家那叫有见识
No. N-No, I-I'm discerning.

68
00:02:55,460 --> 00:02:57,620
势利小人的常用借口
Official slogan for snobs.

69
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:59,880
我们第一次见面时 他都没正眼瞧过我
When we first met, he wouldn't even look at me...

70
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:02,560
因为我只是一个密苏里来的乡巴佬
because I was a hick from the farm in Missouri,

71
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:04,340
而他却是个城市佬
and he's a big city mouse.

72
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,900
谁会说"城市佬"这个词
Who says "City mouse"?

73
00:03:07,380 --> 00:03:08,680
与乡巴佬对应嘛
Country mice.

74
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:14,320
-我还是去车里等吧 -好的
- I think I'm gonna go wait in the car. - Okay.

75
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,900
你出去时能顺手把垃圾给倒了吗
Hey, if you're on your way out, can you grab the garbage?

76
00:03:17,020 --> 00:03:18,960
-我已经倒了 -那好 用不着你了
- I got it. - Okay. We got it.

77
00:03:20,392 --> 00:03:22,680
-他有点坐不住啊 -你想想看
- He's a little jumpy. - Oh, go figure-

78
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:25,270
哪个小男生想跟女朋友老爹一块玩儿
a teenage boy doesn't want to hang out with his girlfriend's dad.

79
00:03:25,270 --> 00:03:26,026
我以为我们的关系早超越那个了
Thought we were past all that.

80
00:03:26,122 --> 00:03:26,587
我还想
I'm all about-

81
00:03:26,980 --> 00:03:31,360
-跟他培养超亲密关系呢 -是吗
- I'm all about taking it to the next level. - Really?

82
00:03:32,180 --> 00:03:34,080
-我还以为你会踏实点呢 -本来也是
- Thought you were all about keeping it real. - Yes.

83
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:35,980
但是做得踏实一点
But the whole point of keeping it real is

84
00:03:35,980 --> 00:03:37,320
也是为了能发展超亲密关系
so you can take it to the next level.

85
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:38,520
你是真不明白吗
Did you really not know that?

86
00:03:38,780 --> 00:03:41,300
你跟我爸可没有发展超亲密关系呢
You haven't exactly taken it to the next level with my dad.

87
00:03:41,660 --> 00:03:42,800
你在瞎说什么啊
What are you talking about?

88
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,720
我们都结婚16年了
We've been married for 16 years,

89
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:46,960
你在我爸身边还畏畏缩缩的放不开
and you still walk on eggshells around him.

90
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:48,920
什么 开什么玩笑啊
What? Are you kidding?

91
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,580
我跟杰那可是铁哥们儿
Jay and I are total buds.

92
00:03:55,715 --> 00:03:57,297
你只是想找个伴出去玩玩吗
You-You want to just hang out?

93
00:03:58,208 --> 00:04:00,255
我带上了6个好哥们儿[啤酒] 所以
Brought six friends, so that just-

94
00:04:01,968 --> 00:04:02,993
就是...
That's-

95
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:23,220
曼尼把他最喜欢的桌游带来跟卢克一起玩
Manny brought his favorite game to play with Luke.

96
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:24,440
叫帝国时代
It's called Empire.

97
00:04:24,900 --> 00:04:28,060
玩家要运用策略 攻城掠地 一统天下
You use strategy to expand territories and take over the world.

98
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:31,280
卢克会爱死这游戏的 他正在后院玩呢
Luke is gonna love that. He's out back playing.

99
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:33,280
我要出去买东西 需要给你带点什么回来吗
Do you need me to get you something while I'm out shopping?

100
00:04:33,460 --> 00:04:35,460
多谢好意了 不过用不着 多谢
That's such a nice offer, but I think we're good. Thanks.

101
00:04:35,580 --> 00:04:37,480
你看 这样如何
Okay. What about this?

102
00:04:38,180 --> 00:04:39,960
你都不跟歌洛莉亚和曼尼打招呼的吗
You don't even say "Hello" To Gloria and Manny?

103
00:04:40,380 --> 00:04:43,620
嗨 歌洛莉亚和曼尼 妈 到底怎么样
Hi, Gloria and Manny. Okay, Mom, what about this?

104
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:46,740
-不行 必须穿裙子 -妈 拜托
- No. You're wearing a dress. - Mom, come on.

105
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:49,380
怎么啦 今天一下午穿得像个女孩会死吗
What? It's gonna kill you to look like a girl for one afternoon?

106
00:04:49,500 --> 00:04:52,479
要结婚的可是你的朋友 虽然我完全没听说过
But it's a wedding for some friend of yours I never even heard of.

107
00:04:52,479 --> 00:04:55,400
没得商量 裙子你可以再去跟海莉借
It's non-negotiable. You can borrow a dress of Haley's again.

108
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:55,840
才不要
No.

109
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:58,900
那会让人错以为 我是不争气的海莉
That sends an ugly message- that I'm Haley.

110
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:02,280
比起逼着我穿裙子
You know, instead of trying to force me to wear a dress,

111
00:05:02,620 --> 00:05:05,240
你是不是更该操心怎么让卢克穿裤子
why don't you worry about getting Luke to wear some pants?

112
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:09,700
什么 他这是要闹哪样
What? Why does he do this?

113
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:12,720
卢克
Luke!

114
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:14,340
拜托 快穿裤子
Pants! Come on!

115
00:05:19,220 --> 00:05:21,160
我跟杰真是铁哥们儿 真的
Jay and I are buds, for sure-

116
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:24,416
但我们的亲密关系外界看不出来
but with kind of, um, an invisible asterisk.

117
00:05:24,595 --> 00:05:27,841
他嘛 不是很爱说话
Um, he's not, uh- He's not a talker.

118
00:05:27,911 --> 00:05:30,660
也不喜欢拥抱
Or-Or a hugger.

119
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:33,140
有一次他开车碾过我的脚
Once he ran over my foot with his car.

120
00:05:33,212 --> 00:05:35,551
不过说实话 那时他刚戒烟很烦躁
To-To be fair, he had just given up smoking,

121
00:05:35,613 --> 00:05:38,126
但基本上我们绝对是铁哥们儿
but basically we're-we're buds.

122
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:41,420
你非得在那傻站着吗
Do you have to just stand there?

123
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,660
你这样弄得我很不自在
You're making me feel uneasy.

124
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:49,840
老天啊 你就坐那吧
Oh, for God's sake. Sit here. Here.

125
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:52,620
像这样扶住机翼 我要调下这边
Hold this wing like this while I adjust this.

126
00:05:52,780 --> 00:05:53,160
好的
Okay.

127
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,780
过来 坐这儿
Come on. Here.

128
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,080
不要太用力
Not too hard.

129
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:12,600
艾丽克斯 何不跟我购物去呢
Alex, why don't you come shopping with me?

130
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,180
也许我能帮你找到些你喜欢的东西
Maybe I can help you find something that you like.

131
00:06:15,180 --> 00:06:18,440
多谢你的好意了 但她不怎么喜好逛街
That's a really nice offer, but it's not really her thing.

132
00:06:18,940 --> 00:06:20,640
实际上 我挺想去的
Actually, I'd love to go.

133
00:06:21,140 --> 00:06:22,720
老实说 你完全不知道我的喜好是什么
See, you don't know what my thing is.

134
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:24,300
你对我的喜好一无所知
You have no idea what my thing is.

135
00:06:25,140 --> 00:06:26,300
我知道得非常清楚
I know what your thing is.

136
00:06:26,580 --> 00:06:29,260
你就爱激怒老娘发火 你姐呢
Your thing is to provoke, just like your sister's thing...

137
00:06:29,260 --> 00:06:30,580
就是一天到晚宅在房里
is to never come out of her room,

138
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,920
而你那个老弟呢
and your brother's thing-

139
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,459
就好这一口
Well, there's your brother's thing.

140
00:06:34,232 --> 00:06:38,338
卢克 快穿上裤子
Luke! Put 'em on! Mm-hmm.

141
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:41,710
我跟杰的关系存在的问题就是...
The thing about me and Jay is our relationship's...

142
00:06:41,710 --> 00:06:42,610
总是停滞不前
always been stuck in that,

143
00:06:42,660 --> 00:06:45,740
总在原地踏步
that primal place where it started.

144
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:48,580
你懂的 他就像个护雌的银背大猩猩
You know, he's the old silverback protecting his females,

145
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:51,980
一旦有一只更年轻力壮的猩猩进入族群
then along comes this younger, stronger gorilla swinging in,

146
00:06:51,980 --> 00:06:52,780
把老的那只打败了
beating his chest.

147
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:55,780
你懂的 很自然的 那些雌猩猩就会
You know, naturally, the ape ladies come running,

148
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:58,000
投怀送抱 求勾搭求包养
presenting their nice scarlet behinds.

149
00:06:58,140 --> 00:07:00,760
猩猩爸爸想要阻止 但办不到
Papa ape wants to stop all that, but he can't.

150
00:07:00,825 --> 00:07:04,038
你明白吗 生命规律就是那样的 我不是敌人
You know? That's-That's life. I'm not the enemy.

151
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:06,580
偷猎者才是
The enemy is poachers.

152
00:07:12,100 --> 00:07:15,480
好了 别碰
That'll do it. Don't touch it.

153
00:07:19,940 --> 00:07:21,060
好吧
All right.

154
00:07:25,897 --> 00:07:27,688
-一起玩飞机去吗 -好啊
- You wanna go fly it? - Sure.

155
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:33,960
我拿了牙膏和香皂
Oh. Hey, I got the toothpaste and the soap.

156
00:07:34,740 --> 00:07:36,200
真棒 现在我们都能开杂货店了
Good. Now we can open that general store.

157
00:07:37,220 --> 00:07:38,760
我还以为我们只是来买尿布的呢
I thought we were just here to get diapers.

158
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,960
农场里有句俗话流传很广
We had a saying on the farm:

159
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:41,680
既然已经把骡子拉到集市上...
as long as you're bringing the mule to the market, you-

160
00:07:41,780 --> 00:07:43,720
我感觉到你在对我翻白眼
I feel you rolling your eyes at me.

161
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:47,460
我们是在胡娇组织的一次传奇游戏夜上相识的
We met at one of Pepper's legendary game nights.

162
00:07:47,660 --> 00:07:48,660
我对米奇尔有印象是因为
I remember Mitchell because

163
00:07:48,660 --> 00:07:51,360
每当我兴奋地喊叫 他就冲我翻白眼
he kept rolling his eyes every time I would get a little boisterous.

164
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:52,380
我才没有
I did not.

165
00:07:52,860 --> 00:07:53,680
有一点儿哦
A little bit.

166
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:55,720
好吧 或许吧
Yeah, maybe a little bit.

167
00:07:56,149 --> 00:07:58,280
总之 我们在玩字谜游戏时
Anyway, we were- we were playing charades,

168
00:07:58,280 --> 00:08:00,340
我不知道该怎么把线索用手势表演出来
and I had no idea how to act out my clue.

169
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:03,200
我只能想到这么来比划
And all I could think of to do was-

170
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:06,280
而小卡立马就回答到
And without missing a beat, Cam says-

171
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:07,600
卡萨布兰卡
Casablanca.

172
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,940
-我就这么比划了下 -卡萨布兰卡
- All I did was this- - Casablanca.

173
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:12,360
卡萨布兰卡
Casablanca.

174
00:08:13,260 --> 00:08:14,920
我们能不能只拿尿布 买单闪人
Can we just please get the diapers and get out of here?

175
00:08:15,060 --> 00:08:17,040
没问题 不过我想先去瞧瞧酒水区
Fine, but I wanna stop by the wine section first.

176
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:20,120
等等 这儿居然有酒水区
Wait. There's a wine section?

177
00:08:20,300 --> 00:08:22,140
当然 挺棒的 就在轮胎区后面
Yeah, a really good one- just past the tires.

178
00:08:22,340 --> 00:08:25,560
不可能 他们才没有... 天呐
No way. They do not have- Oh, my God.

179
00:08:25,815 --> 00:08:29,280
天啊 小卡 是我想要的那种碎纸机耶
Oh, my- Cam. Cam. The paper shredder I wanted.

180
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:30,920
瞧瞧 五彩纸屑 还能横切
Huh? Confetti and crosscut.

181
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:31,580
棒
Yep.

182
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:36,440
老天啊 好满足呀
Oh, my God. Amazing.

183
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,000
是啊
Yeah.

184
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:44,120
小卡 这地方叫什么
Cam, what is this place?

185
00:08:47,420 --> 00:08:50,400
此香只应天上有 是你的独家秘方吗
Those cookies smell like heaven. Your own recipe?

186
00:08:50,676 --> 00:08:53,020
不 我只是随便丢进烤箱烤烤罢了
No, I just throw 'em in the oven.

187
00:08:53,020 --> 00:08:55,080
但加了爱心作为神秘配料对吧
And added the secret ingredient of caring?

188
00:08:56,060 --> 00:08:56,560
没错
Sure.

189
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:59,320
你跟卢克玩得开心吗
So, you and Luke having a good time?

190
00:08:59,660 --> 00:09:01,980
我也不知道 他不愿意把头上的盒子拿掉
I don't know. He won't come out of his box.

191
00:09:03,020 --> 00:09:05,580
也许我可以待在这儿 跟姐姐聊会儿天
Maybe I'll just stay here and spend some time with my sister.

192
00:09:06,420 --> 00:09:08,920
对噢 好像严格说来 我是你继姐哦
Oh, right. I guess technically I would be your stepsister.

193
00:09:10,060 --> 00:09:12,400
我妈不让我们说"继"字儿
My mother says we are never to use the word "Step"

194
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:13,619
因为那意味着不是真的
Because it means "Not real."

195
00:09:13,619 --> 00:09:15,713
而我们是个真正意义上的家庭
And we are a real family. Mmm.

196
00:09:17,047 --> 00:09:19,120
有什么问题吗 克莱尔
So what is the matter, Claire?

197
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:23,120
-什么 -你看起来不大高兴啊
- What? - You seem sad.

198
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:26,800
让艾丽克斯给气饱了
It's just stuff with Alex.

199
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:28,120
小孩子的问题 你懂的
You know, kid stuff.

200
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:29,200
小孩子
Kids.

201
00:09:29,420 --> 00:09:31,800
别跟我提孩子 我学校里一堆小屁孩
You don't have to tell me. My school is full of them.

202
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:37,740
我想 午饭后我们能一起去逛街
I was thinking after lunch we can go and do a little shopping.

203
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:39,720
我可不会买裙子的
I'm not getting a dress.

204
00:09:40,340 --> 00:09:41,740
我才不管 我又不是你妈
I don't care. I'm not your mother.

205
00:09:42,180 --> 00:09:43,900
我知道 你是我外婆嘛
I know. You're my grandmother.

206
00:09:44,380 --> 00:09:45,340
继--外婆
Step-grandmother.

207
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:49,119
不管怎么说 今天就把我当成你的闺蜜
Anyways, today, think of me as a girlfriend.

208
00:09:49,119 --> 00:09:52,449
午后时光 两个小闺蜜一起找点乐子
Two girls out for an afternoon of fun.

209
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:55,640
你一般跟你的闺蜜们干什么呢
What do you usually do with your girlfriends?

210
00:09:56,520 --> 00:10:00,100
不一定 逛街啊八卦啊喝酒啊
I don't know. We go out. We talk, drink wine.

211
00:10:00,280 --> 00:10:01,720
-我能喝酒吗 -没门儿
- Can I drink wine? - No.

212
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:03,740
真"够朋友"
Some friend.

213
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:07,140
你可以跟我聊聊天啊 什么话题都行
Well, you can still talk to me about anything.

214
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:10,320
大人们都这么说 但都是口是心非
Yeah, adults always say that, but they don't mean it.

215
00:10:10,460 --> 00:10:12,240
每次我妈说我想问什么都行
When my mom says I can ask her anything,

216
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:13,680
其实根本不行
I really can't.

217
00:10:13,828 --> 00:10:15,151
我的问题直接把她逼疯
She just freaks out.

218
00:10:15,820 --> 00:10:18,380
我不会被逼疯的 放心说吧
I won't freak out. Shoot.

219
00:10:20,060 --> 00:10:20,420
那好
Okay.

220
00:10:21,700 --> 00:10:23,140
你跟几个男人上过床
How many men have you slept with?

221
00:10:23,460 --> 00:10:24,940
8个 下个问题
Eight. Next.

222
00:10:30,660 --> 00:10:32,740
-我能试试吗 -不行
- Now can I try it? - No.

223
00:10:34,740 --> 00:10:37,000
我也应该买一个 我爱死飞机了
I should get one of those. I've always loved planes.

224
00:10:37,618 --> 00:10:39,680
如果上天能给我一次重来的机会
If things had gone a little differently in my life,

225
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:40,640
我可能是个飞行员
I think I would have been a pilot.

226
00:10:42,300 --> 00:10:43,800
如果把遥控开关关了
Hey, what would happen if you turned the remote off

227
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:44,960
然后又马上打开会发生什么事呢
and then back on real fast?

228
00:10:45,340 --> 00:10:47,880
你还真是个当飞行员的"好料子"
Yeah, you'd have been a great pilot.

229
00:10:49,535 --> 00:10:51,380
那个 你能来个空中大回旋吗
So, can you do a- Can you do a loop-de-loop?

230
00:10:51,380 --> 00:10:52,040
只要我想就行
If I wanted to.

231
00:10:52,300 --> 00:10:54,160
不是吧 能让我试试吗
No way! Can I try it?

232
00:10:54,580 --> 00:10:55,020
不行
No.

233
00:10:58,300 --> 00:11:00,620
我知道你为什么爱玩飞机了 能修身养性
I can see why you like this. It's so peaceful.

234
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:05,680
就像世界的纷纷扰扰 全不见了一样
It's like the whole world just... disappears out here.

235
00:11:08,603 --> 00:11:10,337
-我还记得有年夏天 -我跟你说
- I remember this one summer- - I'll tell you what.

236
00:11:11,100 --> 00:11:13,220
我还会个绝招 叫"穿针引线"
There's another trick called "Threading the needle."

237
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:14,898
克莱尔和米奇还小的时候我常做给他们看
I used to do it with Claire and Mitch when they were kids.

238
00:11:14,898 --> 00:11:16,720
-想看看吗 -要怎么弄
- You wanna try it? - How's it go?

239
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:18,620
从那边拿个圈圈
You grab one of those hoops over there...

240
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:21,520
然后走到很远很远很远的地方
and go to the far, far, far end of the field...

241
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:25,040
站着别动 我会让飞机从圈圈里钻过去
and stand there, and I fly the plane through it.

242
00:11:25,620 --> 00:11:27,780
听起来真酷
Um, that sounds awesome!

243
00:11:28,060 --> 00:11:30,200
-然后我也能试下吗 -不行
- And then I get a chance flying it? - No.

244
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:30,740
好吧
Okay.

245
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:44,560
这儿行不
How's this?

246
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,660
不够远 再站远点
Not far enough. Go on.

247
00:11:46,860 --> 00:11:49,260
-好的 -越远越好
- Okay. Further down. - You can't go too far.

248
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:52,340
好的 我懂的
Right. Okay, I get it. I get it.

249
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:58,920
-站这儿行不 -挺好
- How's this? - Good.

250
00:11:59,560 --> 00:12:02,079
站好了 千万别动
Now stand still. Don't move.

251
00:12:02,079 --> 00:12:05,673
好的 来吧
Okay, let's do it. Whoo!

252
00:12:06,559 --> 00:12:08,486
太酷了 我喜欢
Whoo! I love it!

253
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,840
我就喜欢
I love... it!

254
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:24,680
你拿飞机爆了我的头
You drove a plane into my face.

255
00:12:24,740 --> 00:12:26,600
肯定是你动了 我说了不许动的
You must have moved. I told you to stay still.

256
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,580
-人家才没动 -闭嘴
- I didn't move. - Try not to talk.

257
00:12:28,740 --> 00:12:29,980
我先检查一下飞机有没有坏
I want to make sure nothing's broken.

258
00:12:32,340 --> 00:12:33,757
我跟艾丽克斯不止是意见不能统一
Alex and I can't just disagree.

259
00:12:33,757 --> 00:12:36,780
她还总能把事儿闹大
I mean, she has to turn everything into a fight.

260
00:12:36,780 --> 00:12:38,780
独立的女强人嘛
Hmm. A strong, independent woman.

261
00:12:39,040 --> 00:12:40,840
听上去跟我认识的另外一个人一样
Sounds like somebody else I know.

262
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:42,460
但我从来都没有恶意
I was never hostile though.

263
00:12:42,460 --> 00:12:44,600
我的意思是 关于穿裙子的问题
I mean, this whole thing with the dress-

264
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:46,337
海莉可从来不这样
Never had this problem with Haley.

265
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:49,180
也许艾丽克斯只是不想被拿来跟她姐比
Maybe Alex doesn't want to compete with her big sister.

266
00:12:49,660 --> 00:12:51,760
或许她只是想做独一无二的自己
Maybe she's trying to create her own identity.

267
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:54,080
一旦她穿上裙子 她的独特之处就消失了
Put her in a dress, and she disappears.

268
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,680
就一下午都不行吗
For one afternoon?

269
00:12:55,980 --> 00:12:58,480
要让我放弃做自己 哪怕一秒钟都不行
I wouldn't give up being myself for even one second.

270
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:02,860
有时候真不敢相信你才10岁
Sometimes it's hard to remember you're only 10 years old.

271
00:13:03,220 --> 00:13:05,360
-10岁零9个月 -好吧
- And three-quarters. - Yeah.

272
00:13:08,780 --> 00:13:10,080
我是米奇尔 你们要吃橄榄吗
Hey, it's Mitchell. Do you guys eat olives?

273
00:13:10,340 --> 00:13:10,820
橄榄吗
Olives?

274
00:13:11,060 --> 00:13:12,520
-特棒的橄榄要吗 -好啊
- Really good olives? - Yeah.

275
00:13:12,980 --> 00:13:14,080
那我给你带了啊
You got it.

276
00:13:14,740 --> 00:13:17,160
米奇尔 我找到尿布在哪了 就在那
Mitchell, I found the diapers. They're over here.

277
00:13:17,340 --> 00:13:19,040
卡梅隆 你猜猜我发现到什么了
Cameron, guess what I found?

278
00:13:19,620 --> 00:13:20,020
棺材
Coffins.

279
00:13:20,148 --> 00:13:22,414
他们既卖婴幼儿奶粉 又卖棺材
They sell baby formula and they sell coffins.

280
00:13:22,414 --> 00:13:23,390
你简直可以买到
You can buy literally buy

281
00:13:23,390 --> 00:13:25,400
从你出生到去世需要用到的一切东西
everything you need from birth to death.

282
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:27,520
苍天大地啊 看看这些尿布
Oh, my God. Look at these diapers.

283
00:13:27,980 --> 00:13:29,400
真便宜
Look how cheap they are!

284
00:13:29,490 --> 00:13:30,520
你知道我们应该怎么做吗
Oh. You know what we should do?

285
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:32,180
我们应该买够一两年用的 对不
We should get enough for the next year or two, right?

286
00:13:32,500 --> 00:13:33,920
那我们把它放哪呢
Where would we keep them?

287
00:13:35,100 --> 00:13:37,000
-他们正好也卖棚子嘛 -真的吗
- They sell sheds. - Really?

288
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:38,420
你真要买个堆放尿布的棚吗
You want to buy a diaper shed?

289
00:13:38,820 --> 00:13:40,940
我们要变成家里盖有尿布棚的家伙了对吗
We're those guys now? The guys with a diaper shed?

290
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:42,380
再拿两包
Just grab two more.

291
00:13:42,780 --> 00:13:44,240
我才不要 米奇尔
I'm not grabbing two more, Mitchell.

292
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:45,078
我们该走了
It's time to go.

293
00:13:45,078 --> 00:13:48,160
淡定嘛 我们得...不好意思
Come on, come on. We need, uh- Hey, excuse me.

294
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:50,500
-你从哪找的平板车 -就在那边
- Where did you get that flatbed thing? - Over there.

295
00:13:50,625 --> 00:13:53,120
-我们也去弄一辆 -不是吧你
- Go grab one of those. - Really?

296
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,140
当然了 两辆才够
Yeah. Get two.

297
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:59,300
我在苹果酱那排等你
I'm in the applesauce aisle.

298
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:00,480
不管怎么说
So, anyways,

299
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:02,320
猜字谜游戏之后我们一起去喝咖啡了
after charades, we went out for coffee.

300
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:04,520
然后我了解到他喜欢艺术
And I learned that he loves art.

301
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:07,780
他会弹钢琴 还会说法语
He plays the piano. He speaks French.

302
00:14:07,780 --> 00:14:09,358
-略懂 -听见没
- Un peu. - You see?

303
00:14:09,358 --> 00:14:10,817
我对他的第一印象完全不靠谱
I-I misjudged him.

304
00:14:11,254 --> 00:14:12,902
没错 我就跟好市多卖场一样
Yeah, I'm sort of like Costco.

305
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:15,720
我身躯庞大 土里土气 但引人迷恋
I'm big, I'm not fancy, and I dare you to not like me.

306
00:14:15,869 --> 00:14:17,878
没错 而我就更像是那个...
Yeah, and I'm kinda more like that, um-

307
00:14:19,560 --> 00:14:22,120
我们在巴黎逛的那个小店叫什么来着
What is the name of that little shop we went to in Paris?

308
00:14:23,060 --> 00:14:24,720
你个势利小人
You are such a snob.

309
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:28,280
卡萨布兰卡
Casablanca.

310
00:14:30,860 --> 00:14:32,680
我脚脖子上纹了朵小花
I have a small flower on my ankle...

311
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:36,360
还纹了一只小蝴蝶在我的 大腿上
and a tiny little butterfly on my... thigh.

312
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:38,140
大腿根部吗
How high up?

313
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:41,120
-靠近"中心地带" -你是为了性感才纹的吗
- Pretty high. - Did you do it to look sexy?

314
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:44,460
不 你是为男人纹的吗 我外公喜欢吗
No- - Did you do it for a guy? Does Grandpa like it?

315
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:46,540
否 否 是
No, no and yes.

316
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:47,860
恶心
That's gross

317
00:14:49,180 --> 00:14:51,920
-继续说说你的耳洞吧 -才不要
- Let's go back to your piercings. - No, no, no.

318
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:53,500
我回答了这么多问题
I've answered enough of your questions.

319
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:55,260
现在轮到你来回答一个了
Now it's your turn to answer one.

320
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,040
什么问题
What is it?

321
00:14:57,560 --> 00:14:58,940
你为什么不想穿裙子
Why you don't want to wear a dress?

322
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:02,480
因为我不想穿得像海莉和她那帮蠢伴一样
Because I don't want to look like Haley and her stupid friends.

323
00:15:02,554 --> 00:15:05,211
我也穿裙子 我也不像海莉啊
I wear dresses and I don't look like Haley.

324
00:15:05,274 --> 00:15:08,775
你就是海莉 40年后的版本
You are Haley, just 40 years older.

325
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:09,860
-10年后的 -20年后的
- Ten. - Twenty.

326
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:13,160
好吧 艾丽克斯 这你也要跟我吵吗
Deal. Alex, why are you fighting me on this?

327
00:15:13,232 --> 00:15:15,438
其实 穿裙子也没什么大不了的
Just- It doesn't matter if I dress up.

328
00:15:15,438 --> 00:15:17,427
只是我没有你跟海莉那么漂亮
I'm not pretty like Haley and you.

329
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:20,020
-胡扯 你美翻了 -才不是
- That's ridiculous! You're beautiful. - I'm not.

330
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:23,260
不过没关系 我聪明过人
But that's okay. I'm the smart one.

331
00:15:23,378 --> 00:15:27,140
那个帅哥服务员可不知道你的智商多高
The cute busboy doesn't know that you're smart.

332
00:15:27,140 --> 00:15:27,500
什么
What?

333
00:15:27,740 --> 00:15:30,160
他每次过来续杯 都冲你微笑示意
He's been smiling at you every time he comes to the table.

334
00:15:30,300 --> 00:15:31,200
才没有
He does not!

335
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:33,480
要不然你以为他为何就给我们上了面包呢
Why do you think we are the only people with bread?

336
00:15:35,860 --> 00:15:40,680
听着 有一天你也会想跟那样的帅小伙约会
Look. One day you're going to want to date a cute guy like that.

337
00:15:40,860 --> 00:15:43,980
等到那时候 你也会希望自己光彩动人
And when that day comes, you're going to want to look beautiful,

338
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:47,060
那时你就会穿裙子了
and then you'll wear a dress.

339
00:15:48,620 --> 00:15:50,120
那你亲过女生吗
So, you ever kiss another girl?

340
00:15:50,718 --> 00:15:53,266
跟外婆可不能这么说话
That's no way to talk to your grandmother.

341
00:15:53,620 --> 00:15:55,340
我成长过程中 我妈对我严苛吗
Was my mom hard on me growing up?

342
00:15:55,560 --> 00:15:56,660
是 绝对是
Yeah, she was.

343
00:15:57,040 --> 00:15:58,560
但是你知道吗 当时
But you know what? Back then

344
00:15:58,700 --> 00:16:01,412
贝蒂·弗莱顿和格洛莉亚·斯坦正火着呢
everything was Betty Friedan and Gloria Steinem.

345
00:16:01,412 --> 00:16:03,000
她们都不明白...
They didn't understand-

346
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,740
-我们回来了哟 -好啊
- Hola! We're back. - Hello.

347
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:07,420
-逛得咋样啊 -非常棒
- Hey, how'd it go? - It was great.

348
00:16:07,788 --> 00:16:10,020
-你跟卢克玩得开心吗 -这个嘛
- Did you have fun with Luke? - Well, not-

349
00:16:10,020 --> 00:16:11,320
我们姐弟俩谈得很开心
We had a great time.

350
00:16:12,220 --> 00:16:16,100
艾丽克斯 我想过了
Alex, I've been thinking, and...

351
00:16:16,100 --> 00:16:17,540
你不想穿裙子参加婚礼
if you don't want to wear a dress to the wedding,

352
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:18,800
也没什么大不了的
it's not the end of the world.

353
00:16:19,292 --> 00:16:22,133
没关系 我买了一条
It's all right. I bought one.

354
00:16:23,820 --> 00:16:25,520
现在你看到她是怎么气我的了吗
Do you see how she has to provoke me?

355
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:27,418
我们下周再聊这个话题
We'll talk about it next week.

356
00:16:27,418 --> 00:16:28,755
克莱尔
Claire!

357
00:16:29,244 --> 00:16:31,349
让开道 进来
Clear the way. Coming through. Ow!

358
00:16:31,471 --> 00:16:33,299
小心点 注意 伙计
Coming through. Easy. Easy, fella. Ow!

359
00:16:33,420 --> 00:16:35,260
-我的脸得好好歇歇了 -你没事的
- I need to rest my face. - You're fine.

360
00:16:35,336 --> 00:16:36,712
你会没事的 坚持住
You'll be all right. Hang on.

361
00:16:36,777 --> 00:16:38,696
-老天啊 -进家门了
- Oh, my God! - Get the door.

362
00:16:38,772 --> 00:16:39,965
爸
Ah! Dad?

363
00:16:40,040 --> 00:16:41,160
小事故 没啥大不了的
Little accident. Nothing big.

364
00:16:41,420 --> 00:16:43,520
-是飞机失事啦 -发生什么事了
- I was in a plane crash. - What happened?

365
00:16:43,700 --> 00:16:45,640
我们正在玩穿针引线那一招 有人动了
We were threading the needle, and somebody moved.

366
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:48,340
哪有 人家才没有 你是故意的
No, I didn't. You did it on purpose.

367
00:16:48,553 --> 00:16:50,280
他吃了止痛药 说胡话呢
That's the painkiller talking.

368
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:51,600
他有点晕乎乎的
He's a little loopy.

369
00:16:51,911 --> 00:16:54,022
-到底有多严重 -机翼裂了
- How bad is it? - Well, the wing is cracked,

370
00:16:54,022 --> 00:16:56,600
-螺旋桨也折了 但我 -我指菲尔
- the propeller's bent, but I can- I can- - I mean Phil.

371
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:58,920
-飞机失事了 -真"谢谢"你了 爸
- I was in a plane crash. - Thanks, Dad.

372
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:01,780
我又没让他站那 他非得去
I didn't ask him to be there. He insisted.

373
00:17:02,260 --> 00:17:03,840
他非要冒险 就这样而已
He took a chance. This is what happened.

374
00:17:03,940 --> 00:17:05,540
就像你上次开车轧他脚一样
Kind of like the time you ran over his foot.

375
00:17:05,660 --> 00:17:06,640
你轧过他的脚吗
You ran over his foot?

376
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:08,720
-意外而已 -爸 你明明是故意的
- That was an accident. - You know, Dad, you did it on purpose.

377
00:17:08,820 --> 00:17:10,580
我们都看到草坪上的轮胎印了
We all saw the tire marks on the lawn.

378
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:11,936
我那会儿刚戒烟嘛
I had just quit smoking.

379
00:17:11,936 --> 00:17:14,520
瞧 你说得你老公心烦意乱了
See, you're upsetting your husband.

380
00:17:14,520 --> 00:17:16,580
-水 -我去拿
- Water. - I'll get it.

381
00:17:20,632 --> 00:17:21,728
你还好吧
Ay. You okay?

382
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:23,480
歌洛莉亚 谢谢老天爷 你在这
Gloria! Thank God you're here.

383
00:17:23,980 --> 00:17:25,100
别担心 我也在这儿
Don't worry. I'm here too.

384
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,040
你是谁啊
Who's this?

385
00:17:28,700 --> 00:17:29,600
不是我的错
Wasn't my fault.

386
00:17:29,860 --> 00:17:32,240
我见你玩过无数次"穿针引线"那一招
I have seen you thread the needle a million times.

387
00:17:32,420 --> 00:17:33,300
你从来没失过手
You never miss.

388
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:34,500
没错 我大概是宝刀已老
Yeah. I must be getting old.

389
00:17:34,500 --> 00:17:36,840
你为什么就不愿承认呢 你不喜欢菲尔
Why don't you just admit it? You never liked Phil.

390
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:38,780
放下 才不给你吃曲奇饼呢
Put that down. You do not get a cookie.

391
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:39,580
我喜欢菲尔
I like Phil.

392
00:17:39,740 --> 00:17:42,820
只是有时他有点太刻意讨好我了 你懂吗
It's just that sometimes he tries too hard, you know?

393
00:17:42,940 --> 00:17:45,680
实在有点惹人生气
And it's just kind of- irritating.

394
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:47,040
好吧 也许他过于刻意讨好
Okay, maybe he tries too hard

395
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:49,040
因为你从来不主动和他亲近
because you make zero effort with him.

396
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:51,420
你知道吗 在我跟他结婚的16年里
You know what? In the 16 years that we've been married,

397
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:54,120
你有跟他说过一次你喜欢他吗
have you one time told him that you liked him?

398
00:17:54,254 --> 00:17:57,286
-我只是没明确说"喜欢"二字嘛 -才不是
- Not in those exact words, no. - No.

399
00:17:57,380 --> 00:17:58,779
你什么都没说过 爸
Not in any words, Dad.

400
00:17:58,779 --> 00:18:00,499
你知道那让我心里多难过吗
How do you think that makes me feel?

401
00:18:02,840 --> 00:18:04,820
你从没告诉过你的孩子你爱他吗
You've never told your son that you love him?

402
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,560
等等等等 什么时候上升到爱的高度了
Whoa, whoa. When did we jump to love?

403
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:09,160
而且准确地说 他又不是我的孩子
And he's technically not my son.

404
00:18:09,980 --> 00:18:12,540
-那就是说你也不爱曼尼吗 -当然爱
- Ah. So that means that you don't love Manny either? - Sure, I do.

405
00:18:13,100 --> 00:18:14,641
相信我 当我刚刚在公园玩飞机时
I mean, believe me, when I was in that park,

406
00:18:14,641 --> 00:18:16,173
我真希望曼尼跟我一起
I really wished Manny was there.

407
00:18:16,300 --> 00:18:17,080
为什么
For what?

408
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:19,680
那样你就可以用飞机爆他头了是吗
So that you could fly the plane into his head? Huh?

409
00:18:21,580 --> 00:18:24,260
爸 多谢你能把菲尔送回家
Dad, thanks so much for bringing Phil home.

410
00:18:24,340 --> 00:18:28,240
我在他头发里发现了你机翼的碎片
I found one of your little flaps in his hair. So-

411
00:18:30,740 --> 00:18:32,417
实际上 这是副翼的碎片
Actually, this is called an aileron.

412
00:18:32,417 --> 00:18:34,756
-用来保持...-现在重要的是菲尔才对吧
- It controls... - because that's what matters right now.

413
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:36,720
爸 请你离开
Bye, Dad.

414
00:18:46,935 --> 00:18:49,016
-菲尔 -杰
- Hey, Phil. - Jay.

415
00:18:54,069 --> 00:18:55,347
你是陶瓷做的吗
What are you, made of china?

416
00:18:57,240 --> 00:19:00,800
菲尔 我只想让你明白我的歉意
Phil, I just want you to know I'm sorry.

417
00:19:02,051 --> 00:19:04,580
不管是因为我失手了 还是你动了
And whether I, uh, missed or you moved-

418
00:19:04,580 --> 00:19:05,960
-我才没动 -都好
- I didn't. - either way.

419
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:09,440
我只想让你知道 我喜欢你
I just want to say that I like you.

420
00:19:09,620 --> 00:19:12,020
-真的吗 -必须的
- Really? - Yeah.

421
00:19:12,340 --> 00:19:13,660
那你能说说喜欢人家什么地方吗
What do you like about me?

422
00:19:17,140 --> 00:19:18,760
你是个好人
You're a nice guy.

423
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:22,160
非常努力
Try real hard.

424
00:19:23,060 --> 00:19:23,600
没错
I do.

425
00:19:23,746 --> 00:19:25,675
你还是个好父亲
And you're a good dad.

426
00:19:25,675 --> 00:19:28,334
我是个好父亲 快来
Hey, I'm a good dad. Come here.

427
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:29,500
让我熊抱一个
Come here, you.

428
00:19:31,280 --> 00:19:32,840
感觉真棒
This feels so right.

429
00:19:35,660 --> 00:19:36,660
什么情况
What's going on?

430
00:19:37,360 --> 00:19:38,758
发生了一点小意外
There was a little accident,

431
00:19:38,758 --> 00:19:41,960
不过杰在对菲尔表明爱意
but Jay's telling Phil how much he loves him.

432
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:43,420
好吧 菲尔走运了
Oh. Well, that's nice for Phil.

433
00:19:43,500 --> 00:19:44,160
真好
That's great,

434
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:46,000
他可从来没对我男人表现过爱意呢
since he's never said anything like that to my boyfriend.

435
00:19:46,180 --> 00:19:47,640
-别提了 -不行 我气不过
- Let it go. - No, it's not okay.

436
00:19:47,980 --> 00:19:50,520
不 米奇说的对 小卡 你也去抱抱
No, Mitch is right. Go in there too, Cam. Come on.

437
00:19:50,660 --> 00:19:51,500
开什么玩笑
You're kidding.

438
00:19:51,565 --> 00:19:53,345
-杰 -我来吧
- Jay! - I'm gonna get this.

439
00:19:53,453 --> 00:19:55,233
-来吧 小卡 -就抱一小下
- Come on in, Cam. - Just a little hug.

440
00:19:55,297 --> 00:19:56,852
-过来吧 -快说
- Get in here. - Say it.

441
00:19:56,926 --> 00:19:59,375
-我勒个去 -快说 快说
- Whoa! Hey, hey, hey! - Say it! Say it!

442
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:01,120
小卡 我也喜欢你
I like you too, Cam.

443
00:20:01,246 --> 00:20:03,552
-那你喜欢他哪一点 -天呐
- What do you like about him? - Oh, jez.

444
00:20:03,620 --> 00:20:04,820
你从哪弄来的摄影机
Where did you get that camera?

445
00:20:05,080 --> 00:20:06,660
从世上最给力的商场里买来的
Only the greatest store on earth.

446
00:20:08,280 --> 00:20:08,880
谢谢你 爸
Thanks, Dad.

447
00:20:09,449 --> 00:20:11,794
曼尼 照相啦 快来
Manny, picture! Get in there too.

448
00:20:11,967 --> 00:20:14,120
快来 我的好小伙
Get in here, mi amigo. Oh!

449
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:16,180
别动 跟我说"茄子"
Stay still. Say "Cheese."

450
00:20:16,180 --> 00:20:18,220
-别挤我 -茄子
- Don't push it. - Cheese!

451
00:20:18,220 --> 00:20:19,407
拍好了
Picture.

452
00:20:19,407 --> 00:20:21,478
-茄子 -茄子
- Cheese! - Cheese. Queso.

453
00:20:23,153 --> 00:20:24,027
天啊
Oh, boy!

454
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:27,700
不觉得好像伸出手臂就能拥抱全世界吗
Doesn't it feel like these arms could go around the world?

455
00:20:28,660 --> 00:20:29,680
我想我背部好像扭伤了
I think I strained something.

456
00:20:33,020 --> 00:20:34,820
我一直想要个女儿
I always wanted a daughter-

457
00:20:34,820 --> 00:20:37,180
给她穿漂亮的小裙子
to dress her up in pretty dresses,

458
00:20:37,340 --> 00:20:40,740
给她做头发 美甲 化妆
do her hair, her nails, her makeup.

459
00:20:42,900 --> 00:20:46,375
透露个小秘密 曼尼一岁的时候
No one knows this, but for the first year of his life,

460
00:20:46,375 --> 00:20:48,080
我把他打扮得跟个女孩似的
I made up Manny like a girl

461
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:50,100
逢人就说他是我女儿
and told everybody that he was my daughter.

462
00:20:51,634 --> 00:20:53,197
不过也就那么几次
Ay, but just for a few times.

463
00:20:53,620 --> 00:20:55,480
我可不想让他对自己的性别产生困惑
I didn't want to mess with his head.

464
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:56,960
当他看到他小时候的照片
When he found the pictures,

465
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:59,760
我告诉他那是他已经死了的双胞胎姐姐
I told him that it was his twin sister who died.
